   }
  },
  {
   "claim_id": "C2",
   "text": "A fintech API gateway achieved 12% reduction in 99th-percentile latency after enabling QUIC for 30% of traffic, demonstrating real tail-latency value under packet loss. This reflects QUIC's elimination of TCP head-of-line blocking: when multiple API requests share one connection and a packet is lost, only that request's stream stalls; others continue processing.",
